{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A tracking plan is the contract between an app and whoever reads its events: dashboards, a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"warehouse, a collector, another platform’s client. Each event’s document gives its version,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"consent category, properties and their JSON types, which ones every payload holds, and which are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sensitive","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", in a form that needs no Swift to read. Committed beside the events, it puts every","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"change to them in the pull request as a JSON diff. Its check says which changes break what has","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"already shipped: payloads from installed app versions that a validating collector would reject,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and stored records the app could no longer decode.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" turns events’ schemas into files: an index, ","type":"text"},{"code":"tracking-plan.json","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and for each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"event a JSON Schema (draft 2020-12) document and an example payload. The files are values, so the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"same schemas give the same bytes on every run and platform, ready to commit for the people and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tools outside the app.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Checking compares the plan the events make now with the committed one by what the files mean. The","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCheck"},{"text":" is a match, a plan that is only out of date, or one with a breaking","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"difference: a change that, at the same version, would leave a stored record or an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"already-released app’s payload unable to decode or validate. Each ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanDifference"},{"text":" names","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the event, the property and the change, and says whether it is breaking.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Only code compiled against the app’s event types can read their schemas, so the app writes a small"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"executable of its own: a type that conforms to "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCommand","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", marked "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@main"},{"type":"text","text":". It writes"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the plan to a directory, or checks it with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"check"},{"type":"text","text":". To run the check from the app’s tests instead,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TrackingPlanTesting"},{"type":"text","text":". The schemas usually come from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Event"},{"type":"text","text":" (module "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"EventMacros"},{"type":"text","text":"):"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/init()","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" takes every "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@Event"},{"type":"text","text":" in the program and the library’s own events, found at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"run time, and "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/init(schemas:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" takes a list."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The module is a product of its own that ","type":"text"},{"code":"import Traffluent","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" leaves out.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import TrackingPlans","import Traffluent","","@Event(name: \"signed_up\")","struct SignedUp {","    var plan: String","}","","let plan = try TrackingPlan()  \/\/ every @Event in the program, and the library's own","let check = plan.check(against: plan.files)  \/\/ .matches","let paths = plan.files.map(\\.path)","\/\/ [\"tracking-plan.json\", ..., \"signed_up.v1.schema.json\", \"signed_up.v1.example.json\"]"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The plan also writes the schemas of an Iglu registry, which a Snowplow pipeline validates events","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"against (","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/igluFiles(vendor:registry:carryingForward:)","isActive":true},{"text":",","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/writeIgluRegistry(to:vendor:registry:)","isActive":true},{"text":"). Version N of an event is SchemaVer","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"N-0-0"},{"text":". For Iglu Server, a compatible change at the same version is the next addition, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"N-0-1"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and on, superseding the earlier ones; a static repository doesn’t supersede, so there the export","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"refuses it, and so it does a breaking change for either kind: raise the event’s version.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The guide "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/trackingplanworkflow"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"covers the executable, the command plugins and the test."}]}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Export every event an app tracks as JSON Schema that people and services outside the app can read, and check each change against the plan committed before it."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"sections":[],"topicSections":[{"title":"Making a plan","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/File","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanError"],"anchor":"Making-a-plan"},{"title":"Writing a plan","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/files","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/files(carryingForward:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/write(to:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCommand"],"anchor":"Writing-a-plan"},{"title":"Exporting an Iglu registry","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/igluFiles(vendor:registry:carryingForward:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/writeIgluRegistry(to:vendor:registry:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/IgluRegistry","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/IgluExportError"],"anchor":"Exporting-an-Iglu-registry"},{"title":"Checking a plan","identifiers":["doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/check(against:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/check(againstDirectory:)","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanCheck","doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlanDifference"],"anchor":"Checking-a-plan"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackingplans"]}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"TrackingPlans"}],"externalID":"TrackingPlans","symbolKind":"module","roleHeading":"Framework","role":"collection","title":"TrackingPlans"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"references":{"doc://TrackingPlans/documentation/TrackingPlans/TrackingPlan/writeIgluRegistry(to:vendor:registry:)":{"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackingplans\/trackingplan\/writeigluregistry(to:vendor:registry:)","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Writes the plan’s events as the schemas of an Iglu registry of the kind "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"registry"},{"type":"text","text":" under"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vendor"},{"type":"text","text":" into "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"directory"},{"type":"text","text":", the registry’s root, creating the directories needed."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/TrackingPlans\/documentation\/TrackingPlans\/TrackingPlan\/writeIgluRegistry(to:vendor:registry:)","type":"topic","title":"writeIgluRegistry(to:vendor:registry:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"writeIgluRegistry"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"to"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:20FoundationEssentials3URLV","text":"URL"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"vendor"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIde